<title>USA: Congo seeks 3,400 tonnes PL-480 soybean oil-agent.</title>
<headline>Congo seeks 3,400 tonnes PL-480 soybean oil-agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Republic of the Congo seeks to buy 3,400 tonnes of PL-480 tonnes of soybean oil delivered in 20-liter pails, said Amex International Inc, the Congo's buying agent.</p>
<p>Offers are due at the agent's Washington, D.C., office by 1530 EDT/1930 GMT Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shipment is for November 5-20 and offers are to be quoted in U.S. dollars free-alongside-ship.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
